s Postable and ParcelShop deliveries",[138],{"start":61,"end":139,"type":55},19,{"dimensions":141,"alt":143,"copyright":30,"url":144,"id":145,"edit":146},{"width":142,"height":142},40,"Money icon","frequent-seller.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":44,"y":44,"zoom":45,"background":46},{"title":148,"content":149,"icon":159},"Great savings on international parcels",[150],{"type":50,"text":151,"spans":152,"direction":56},"Enjoy 15% off international parcels on Level 1 and 20% off on Level 2",[153,156],{"start":154,"end":155,"type":55},6,13,{"start":157,"end":158,"type":55},51,59,{"dimensions":160,"alt":161,"copyright":30,"url":162,"id":163,"edit":164},{"width":142,"height":142},"Above and beyond icon","frequent-seller.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41bf8079-3dd8-48b6-ad6b-013e68421339_above_and_beyond.svg","YflBvREAACIA8pXG",{"x":44,"y":44,"zoom":45,"background":46},{"title":166,"content":167,"icon":171},"Next Day delivery for less",[168],{"type":50,"text":169,"spans":170,"direction":56},"Choose to upgrade to Next Day UK delivery from just 48p, helping you meet tight shipping deadlines without breaking the bank",[],{"dimensions":172,"alt":173,"copyright":30,"url":174,"id":175,"edit":176},{"width":142,"height":142},"Icon of a clock","frequent-seller.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F40f1b5ea-7a5c-44d7-8e16-86d427c88a1d_its_too_late1.svg","Yh96GBIAACoA-Zsp",{"x":44,"y":44,"zoom":45,"background":46},{"title":178,"content":179,"icon":183},"Simpler pricing, smarter sending",[180],{"type":50,"text":181,"spans":182,"direction":56},"We’ve made it easier to budget with fewer weight bands for UK parcels",[],{"dimensions":184,"alt":185,"copyright":30,"url":186,"id":187,"edit":188},{"width":142,"height":142},"Lightbulb icon","frequent-seller.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F9028d913-9c89-4f01-b423-3fd1d160c4a1_lightbulb.svg","Yh96FRIAACoA-Zru",{"x":44,"y":44,"zoom":45,"background":189},"#fff",{"title":191,"content":192,"icon":196},"Collect Tesco Clubcard points",[193],{"type":50,"text":194,"spans":195,"direction":56},"Start collecting Tesco Clubcard points on every order – now available with your international parcels as well as UK deliveries",[],{"dimensions":197,"alt":198,"copyright":30,"url":199,"id":200,"edit":201},{"width":142,"height":142},"Pricing icon","frequent-seller.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0d6596ea-88df-43fd-b67a-22e944657aa2_pricing.svg","Yh96FhIAACkA-Zrx",{"x":44,"y":44,"zoom":45,"background":46},{"theme":21,"title":203,"description":30},"The benefits you'll love","list_block$082323cb-7a9a-42ac-b8c1-b281fbdc2a1e","list_block",{"variation":207,"version":17,"items":208,"primary":209,"id":227,"slice_type":71,"slice_label":30},"default-slice",[],{"CardImage":210,"CardAvatar":217,"CardTitle":218,"CardText":219,"ButtonText":30,"ButtonUrl":226,"IsEco":27},{"dimensions":211,"alt":213,"copyright":30,"url":214,"id":215,"edit":216},{"width":37,"height":212},643,"A close-up bird's eye view of a customer holding their mobile phone shows the Evri website home page on display. Lots of parcel boxes can be seen in the background.","frequent-seller.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZyIqu68jQArT0BYb_small_business.jpg?auto=format,compress","ZyIqu68jQArT0BYb",{"x":44,"y":44,"zoom":45,"background":46},"none","How does it work?",[220,223],{"type":50,"text":221,"spans":222,"direction":56},"With access to exclusive pricing, you can enjoy even better discounts across UK and international deliveries. Plus, the more parcels you send, the more you save. ",[],{"type":50,"text":224,"spans":225,"direction":56},"Once you've signed up as an Evri Frequent Seller, your exclusive prices will be automatically available.",[],{"link_type":68},"card$e5d70fef-3a76-495e-a35a-9b700e6d7e5b",{"variation":229,"version":230,"ite